{"entity":"story","version":1,"id":"workspace-crate-skeleton","revision":1,"type":"aep.entity.create/v1","from_state":null,"to_state":"draft","changed":{"body":"## Context\n\nEvery P1 story lands in its own crate. The one file they would all otherwise touch is the\nworkspace manifest. This story creates the five P1 crates empty, so no later story edits\n`Cargo.toml` at the root and the rest of the epic can be worked in parallel where its\ndependencies allow.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`task check` exits zero with `ekr-kernel`, `ekr-ontology`, `ekr-graph`, `ekr-store` and `ekr`\npresent as workspace members, each with a crate-level doc comment naming the ESS domain it\nimplements (`systems/ekr/domains/<domain>.yaml`) and no other code.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `Cargo.toml` (workspace members, shared dependencies: `uuid`, `sha2`, `hex`, `serde`,\n  `serde_json`, `thiserror`, `eventlog-*` by git tag)\n- `crates/ekr-kernel/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-ontology/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-graph/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-store/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr/{Cargo.toml,src/main.rs}`\n- `Taskfile.yml` (no change expected; the gate already covers the workspace)\n\n## Notes\n\nComponent map: `systems/ekr/components.yaml`. Every crate opts into `[lints] workspace = true`.\nThe eventlog pin is the current release tag of `beyond10x/eventlog`; read it from that\nrepository's `Cargo.toml` rather than assuming.\n","title":"P1 crate skeleton: five empty workspace members"},"args":{"command":"create-entity","data":{"body":"## Context\n\nEvery P1 story lands in its own crate. The one file they would all otherwise touch is the\nworkspace manifest. This story creates the five P1 crates empty, so no later story edits\n`Cargo.toml` at the root and the rest of the epic can be worked in parallel where its\ndependencies allow.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`task check` exits zero with `ekr-kernel`, `ekr-ontology`, `ekr-graph`, `ekr-store` and `ekr`\npresent as workspace members, each with a crate-level doc comment naming the ESS domain it\nimplements (`systems/ekr/domains/<domain>.yaml`) and no other code.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `Cargo.toml` (workspace members, shared dependencies: `uuid`, `sha2`, `hex`, `serde`,\n  `serde_json`, `thiserror`, `eventlog-*` by git tag)\n- `crates/ekr-kernel/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-ontology/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-graph/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr-store/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs}`\n- `crates/ekr/{Cargo.toml,src/main.rs}`\n- `Taskfile.yml` (no change expected; the gate already covers the workspace)\n\n## Notes\n\nComponent map: `systems/ekr/components.yaml`. Every crate opts into `[lints] workspace = true`.\nThe eventlog pin is the current release tag of `beyond10x/eventlog`; read it from that\nrepository's `Cargo.toml` rather than assuming.\n","status":"draft","title":"P1 crate skeleton: five empty workspace members"},"entity_type":"aep.story/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/workspace-crate-skeleton"},"payload":{"actor":"agent:claude","at":1789955944376,"causation":"cmd-new-story-workspace-crate-skeleton","change":{"change":"created","status":"draft"},"correlation":"protocol-artifact-new","event_id":"story:workspace-crate-skeleton@1#0~d81d5fe465244b83","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-21T01:59:04Z"}}